    {
      "id": "n_join",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "you should join the team and agree on the team's domain"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "Once that is done, create a process model and check it"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "branch",
      "gateway": "XOR"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If the process model is 'NOT OK', then assign negative points"
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If it is still 'NOT OK', assign negative points again"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "However, if the process is okay, you can continue with it"
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If there are any issues, fix them in the next session and extend the process to levels 2 and 3"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If you need to check the process and assign points, continue with the process"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If you need to analyze the field of study, assign roles in the team"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "type": "converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If the process is okay, continue with the process and perform work according to your assigned role"
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "Check the progress and consult any problems that arise"
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If the project is accepted, present it. If not, continue working according to your role"
    },
    {
      "id": "b11",
      "type": "branch",
      "gateway": "XOR"
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "If the project is accepted, present it again. If not, continue working according to your role"
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "type": "action",
      "content": "Finally, present the project and the process will come to an end"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "type": "end"
